    <https://data.archives.gov.on.ca/KB/FindingAidRecord/F%20895-1-0-18>, <https://data.archives.gov.on.ca/KB/FindingAidRecord/F%20895/Peterborough%2C%20Durham%2C%20Victoria>;
  rico:scopeAndContent "Some Registers of Officers of the Upper Canada Militia, 1812-1856, including those for the Peterborough, Durham, and Victoria Regiments. There were many transfers between the various battalions, of officers and names of regiments.  Registers contains the Rank, name, date of Rank and Remarks. Copied from Photostats of Records in the Possession of Library and Archives, Ottawa." .

